{
  "id": "ia-balcao-slider-carrossel",
  "categoria": "slider-ui",
  "conceito": "Carrosséis e sliders para templates Blogger Bootstrap 5.3: carrossel padrão de posts destacados, slider de cards com scroll horizontal (sem Bootstrap Carousel), e carrossel de depoimentos/quotes. Todos sem dependência de biblioteca externa além do Bootstrap já incluído.",
  "carrossel_posts_destaque": {
    "descricao": "Carrossel Bootstrap 5 de slides com post destacado. Cada slide tem imagem de fundo, badge de categoria, título e CTA. Autoplay 5s.",
    "html": "<div id=\"sl-posts-carousel\" class=\"carousel slide carousel-fade\" data-bs-ride=\"carousel\" data-bs-interval=\"5000\">\n  <div class=\"carousel-indicators\">\n    <button type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#sl-posts-carousel\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\" class=\"active\" aria-current=\"true\" aria-label=\"Slide 1\"></button>\n    <button type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#sl-posts-carousel\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\" aria-label=\"Slide 2\"></button>\n    <button type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#sl-posts-carousel\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\" aria-label=\"Slide 3\"></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner rounded-4 overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"carousel-item active\" style=\"min-height:380px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--sl-primary),var(--sl-accent,#7c3aed))\">\n      <div class=\"carousel-caption text-start d-block\" style=\"bottom:auto;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);left:5%;right:5%\">\n        <span class=\"badge bg-white text-dark fw-semibold mb-2\">Tecnologia</span>\n        <h2 class=\"fs-3 fw-bold text-white mb-2\">Os Melhores Apps de 2025</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-white opacity-75 d-none d-md-block\">Confira nossa lista curada dos aplicativos mais úteis do ano.</p>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-light fw-semibold rounded-pill px-3\">Ler Mais</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\" style=\"min-height:380px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10b981,#059669)\">\n      <div class=\"carousel-caption text-start d-block\" style=\"bottom:auto;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);left:5%;right:5%\">\n        <span class=\"badge bg-white text-dark fw-semibold mb-2\">Review</span>\n        <h2 class=\"fs-3 fw-bold text-white mb-2\">Review: Galaxy S25 Ultra</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-white opacity-75 d-none d-md-block\">Testamos durante 30 dias e contamos tudo.</p>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-light fw-semibold rounded-pill px-3\">Ler Mais</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\" style=\"min-height:380px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#d97706)\">\n      <div class=\"carousel-caption text-start d-block\" style=\"bottom:auto;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);left:5%;right:5%\">\n        <span class=\"badge bg-white text-dark fw-semibold mb-2\">Tutorial</span>\n        <h2 class=\"fs-3 fw-bold text-white mb-2\">Como Criar Apps Sem Código</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-white opacity-75 d-none d-md-block\">No-code está revolucionando o desenvolvimento.</p>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-light fw-semibold rounded-pill px-3\">Ler Mais</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <button class=\"carousel-control-prev\" type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#sl-posts-carousel\" data-bs-slide=\"prev\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Anterior</span>\n  </button>\n  <button class=\"carousel-control-next\" type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#sl-posts-carousel\" data-bs-slide=\"next\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Próximo</span>\n  </button>\n</div>",
    "css": "#sl-posts-carousel .carousel-item{min-height:380px}\n#sl-posts-carousel .carousel-caption{max-width:600px}"
  },
  "slider_cards_scroll": {
    "descricao": "Slider de cards com scroll horizontal nativo (overflow-x:auto). Sem Bootstrap Carousel. Botões de seta navegam com JS. Ideal para 'Mais Lidos'.",
    "html": "<div class=\"position-relative\">\n  <div class=\"sl-cards-slider d-flex gap-3 pb-2\" id=\"slCardSlider\" style=\"overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scrollbar-width:none;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch\">\n    <div class=\"sl-slide-card flex-shrink-0\" style=\"width:260px;scroll-snap-align:start\">\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100\">\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <span class=\"badge mb-2\" style=\"background:var(--sl-primary)\">Tech</span>\n          <h5 class=\"card-title\">Post Destaque 1</h5>\n          <p class=\"card-text text-muted small\">Resumo do artigo em até duas linhas de texto.</p>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"stretched-link\"></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sl-slide-card flex-shrink-0\" style=\"width:260px;scroll-snap-align:start\">\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100\">\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <span class=\"badge mb-2\" style=\"background:var(--sl-primary)\">Review</span>\n          <h5 class=\"card-title\">Post Destaque 2</h5>\n          <p class=\"card-text text-muted small\">Resumo do artigo em até duas linhas de texto.</p>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"stretched-link\"></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sl-slide-card flex-shrink-0\" style=\"width:260px;scroll-snap-align:start\">\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100\">\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <span class=\"badge mb-2\" style=\"background:var(--sl-primary)\">Tutorial</span>\n          <h5 class=\"card-title\">Post Destaque 3</h5>\n          <p class=\"card-text text-muted small\">Resumo do artigo em até duas linhas de texto.</p>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"stretched-link\"></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sl-slide-card flex-shrink-0\" style=\"width:260px;scroll-snap-align:start\">\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100\">\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <span class=\"badge mb-2\" style=\"background:var(--sl-primary)\">Games</span>\n          <h5 class=\"card-title\">Post Destaque 4</h5>\n          <p class=\"card-text text-muted small\">Resumo do artigo em até duas linhas de texto.</p>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"stretched-link\"></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-light shadow sl-slider-prev\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('slCardSlider').scrollBy({left:-280,behavior:'smooth'})\" style=\"position:absolute;left:-16px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:2;border-radius:50%;width:36px;height:36px;padding:0\" aria-label=\"Anterior\">\n    <i class=\"bi bi-chevron-left\"></i>\n  </button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-light shadow sl-slider-next\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('slCardSlider').scrollBy({left:280,behavior:'smooth'})\" style=\"position:absolute;right:-16px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:2;border-radius:50%;width:36px;height:36px;padding:0\" aria-label=\"Próximo\">\n    <i class=\"bi bi-chevron-right\"></i>\n  </button>\n</div>",
    "css": ".sl-cards-slider::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n.sl-slide-card .card{transition:transform .2s}\n.sl-slide-card .card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}"
  },
  "carrossel_depoimentos": {
    "descricao": "Carrossel de depoimentos/quotes de leitores. Slide com avatar, nome, avaliação por estrelas e texto. Autoplay com pausa no hover.",
    "html": "<div id=\"sl-testimonials\" class=\"carousel slide\" data-bs-ride=\"carousel\" data-bs-interval=\"4000\" data-bs-pause=\"hover\">\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n    <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n      <div class=\"text-center py-4 px-3\">\n        <div class=\"d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle mb-3\" style=\"width:64px;height:64px;background:var(--sl-primary);color:#fff;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700\">JS</div>\n        <div class=\"mb-2\">\n          <i class=\"bi bi-star-fill text-warning\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bi bi-star-fill text-warning\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bi bi-star-fill text-warning\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bi bi-star-fill text-warning\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bi bi-star-fill text-warning\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <blockquote class=\"blockquote\">\n          <p class=\"fs-5 fst-italic mb-3\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">\"O melhor blog de tecnologia que acompanho. Conteúdo sempre atualizado e explicado de forma clara.\"</p>\n        </blockquote>\n        <cite class=\"fw-bold\" style=\"color:var(--sl-primary)\">João Silva</cite>\n        <p class=\"small text-muted mb-0\">Desenvolvedor Android</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <div class=\"text-center py-4 px-3\">\n        <div class=\"d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle mb-3\" style=\"width:64px;height:64px;background:var(--sl-accent,#7c3aed);color:#fff;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700\">MC</div>\n        <div class=\"mb-2\">\n          <i class=\"bi bi-star-fill text-warning\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bi bi-star-fill text-warning\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bi bi-star-fill text-warning\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bi bi-star-fill text-warning\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bi bi-star-half text-warning\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <blockquote class=\"blockquote\">\n          <p class=\"fs-5 fst-italic mb-3\" style=\"color:var(--sl-text-main)\">\"Os reviews são muito detalhados. Me ajudam muito na hora de escolher qual app baixar.\"</p>\n        </blockquote>\n        <cite class=\"fw-bold\" style=\"color:var(--sl-primary)\">Maria Costa</cite>\n        <p class=\"small text-muted mb-0\">Designer UX</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"carousel-indicators position-static mt-3\">\n    <button type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#sl-testimonials\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\" class=\"active\" style=\"background:var(--sl-primary)\" aria-current=\"true\" aria-label=\"Slide 1\"></button>\n    <button type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#sl-testimonials\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\" style=\"background:var(--sl-primary)\" aria-label=\"Slide 2\"></button>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "css": "#sl-testimonials .carousel-indicators button{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;border:0;opacity:.4}\n#sl-testimonials .carousel-indicators button.active{opacity:1}"
  },
  "notas_tecnicas": [
    "carrossel_posts_destaque usa carousel-fade para transição de opacidade — mais suave que o slide padrão",
    "slider_cards_scroll usa scroll-snap-type:x mandatory para que os cards 'encaixem' ao parar o scroll",
    "O botão de seta usa onclick inline com scrollBy — é a única exceção ao padrão 'sem JS inline' por ser um one-liner",
    "scrollbar-width:none (Firefox) + ::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none} (Chrome/Safari) escondem a scrollbar em todos os navegadores",
    "carrossel_depoimentos: data-bs-pause='hover' evita que o slide avance enquanto o usuário está lendo",
    "carousel-indicators position-static com mt-3 evita que os dots fiquem sobrepostos ao conteúdo do slide"
  ]
}
